    portraitExpression: 21
    localizedTexts:
    - languageCode: en
      text: I had a very productive stare at the horizon earlier.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c052724c165f89a43a01ab84f981b02c, type: 2}
    portraitExpression: 16
    localizedTexts:
    - languageCode: en
      text: The horizon stared back, which felt unprofessional.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c052724c165f89a43a01ab84f981b02c, type: 2}
    portraitExpression: 22
    localizedTexts:
    - languageCode: en
      text: Tomorrow I may file a complaint with the clouds.
